{
  "description": "aggressive with the BCL in the invariant globalization mode: the feature switch System.Globalization.Invariant of UnityLinker (--dotnet-runtime-feature=InvariantGlobalization) and the define IL2CPP_SYSTEM_GLOBALIZATION_INVARIANT of libil2cpp (--compiler-flags of the IL2CPP arguments: the switch in the AppContext at the start, no load of the ICU data), the submodule ICU stripped and the ICU data dropped from the .data file",
